# WAI v2 Migration State — Reference

**Teaching type:** Reference (informational, not executable)
**For AI assistants:** Read this when working on the v2 migration. It tells you what is done, what is not, and what the rules are.

---

## Purpose

This teaching records the completion state of the WAI v2 migration and documents the rules that apply during Phase 3+. Receiving AIs should read this to understand which phases are complete, what rules are in effect, and what schema changes affect lugs.

---

## Prerequisites

None. This is a reference document. Read it anytime to understand v2 migration state.

---

## Migration Status

**Branch:** `wai-v2-migration` (or `main` if Phase 8 merged)
**Safety tag:** `v1.0-pre-migration-2026-03-12`
**Completion:** All 8 phases complete; merged to main; v2.0.0 tag created

