## Verification Checklist

Use this to verify you understand the migration state:

- [ ] You understand all 8 phases are complete
- [ ] You know where the permanent record lives (decision lug)
- [ ] You understand v2 schema changes (PEV fields, status mappings)
- [ ] You can explain the "retired files" rule to someone else
- [ ] You know what to do if WAI-MIGRATION.yaml is missing (it's normal after Phase 8)

